+            "statistics per voxel (surface likelihood exp(-(d-D)^2/2s^2), free-space likelihood "
+            "sigmoid((D-d)/s), valid-view fraction; d voxel-centre distance, D measured ray "
+            "distance at the nearest pixel, s=exp(log_sigma)*mean voxel edge) through a "
+            "zero-initialized bias-free 3->8 projection added after the >=2-view support gate, "
