+            "dense candidates, lifting, fusion, refinement, heads, renderer and bounds are "
+            "unchanged; at initialization C1 and C0 produce identical states.",
+            "C2_difference_from_C1": "frozen V2 surface term disabled (V2 C0 loss)",
+            "depth_bypass": {
